  "detail_text": "Janitorial services at the following Navy Supply Fleet Logistics Center facilities on Navy Air Station (NAS), Sigonella. Building 318, Post Office, NAS 1 Building 537, NAVSUP FLC-SI (HQ), NAS 2 Building 720, Site Sigonella including Post Office, NAS 2 Building 1020, HAZMAT Center, NAS 2 NAVSUP FLC-SI facilities are located at two (2) different geographical areas and it is highly encouraged to schedule a site visit to see the facilities listed above. Key Dates: Site Visit Reservation: 07 April 2026 at 2:00 PM local time (Italy) Site Visit: 10 April 2026 at 8:00 AM local time Questions Due: 13 April 2026 at 2:00 PM local time Quote Due Date: 15 Apr 2026 at 2:00 PM local time Please pay special attention to the instructions found on pages 28 – 30 of the solicitation.",
